			"notes": "### wherever you are, wherever you may be\n\nnothing terribly special in this update, if you're updating. a few small fixes. dolls can 'eat' now.\n\n* Changed doll eating rules to allow eating, at the cost of eating being detrimental to your well-being\n* Made dolls riding players invincible to suffocation unless the player they are riding is suffocating\n* Fixed keysmashing always using ordered spooling\n* Fixed repairing other dolls sometimes showing the wrong particles\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/afamiliarquiet/be-a-doll/compare/1.0.8...1.0.9+fabric-1.21.8"
